why A robe or a blouse for Human and Gnome mages in their late 20s.

# The Alliance mage robe at 26: High Sorcerer Andromath (1939), Ur's Treatise
# on Shadow Magic (1938), Pristine Spider Silk (1940) and Astral Knot Garment
# (1942).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# the treatise in the Tower of Ilgalar and the spiders that drop the silk;
# Forever's Mage class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/, all four unchanged) and
# quest data (quests 1939, 1938, 1940 and 1942,
# checked 2026-10-14) for the races (Human and Gnome only: Skyborne mages have
# no level 26 robe quest) and the reward choice; the quest texts for the
# tower's library and the carrion recluses.
# Bink in Ironforge and Jennea Cannon in Stormwind give the breadcrumb.

step Bink (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip Bink teaches mages in Ironforge's Mystic Ward. Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind afterwards.
  level 26
  accept 1939 npc 5144                        -- Bink

step Jennea Cannon (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Jennea Cannon stands in the Wizard's Sanctum, the tower of the Mage Quarter.
  level 26
  accept 1939 npc 5497                        -- Jennea Cannon

step High Sorcerer Andromath
  zone Stormwind City
  tip High Sorcerer Andromath is in the Wizard's Sanctum too.
  turnin 1939                                 -- High Sorcerer Andromath
  accept 1938

step The Tower of Ilgalar
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Head east through Elwynn Forest into Redridge. The fallen mage's tower of Ilgalar stands in the east of the zone; the treatise is in his library.
  collect 7266 quest 1938.1                   -- Ur's Treatise on Shadow Magic

step Back to Andromath
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 1938                                 -- High Sorcerer Andromath
  accept 1940

step Carrion Recluses
  zone Duskwood
  tip Carrion Recluses lurk in the woods of western Duskwood and each one drops the silk. The Black Widow Hatchlings further east drop it now and then.
  collect 7267 quest 1940.1                   -- Pristine Spider Silk

step Wynne Larson
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Wynne Larson works at Larson Clothiers in the Mage Quarter.
  turnin 1940                                 -- Wynne Larson
  accept 1942
  turnin 1942 choose 7511 9516                -- Astral Knot Garment
